message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SARAI: Sovereignty-Aware Risk Assessment Infrastructure for Reliable Federated Business Intelligence"
abstract: >-
  Companion software artefact for the SARAI manuscript. A Design Science
  Research artefact that federates PostgreSQL and MariaDB behind a single SQL
  endpoint and adds four proactive reliability mechanisms, evaluated against a
  stratified benchmark of 50 federated questions across five business domains
  and five complexity tiers, 24 of which require a genuine cross-engine join.
  50/50 gold queries execute and satisfy their own validators in about 60 s; the
  SQL anomaly detector reaches F1 = 0.980 on adversarial injection workloads.
  The analysis half of reproducibility runs anywhere, and the data half runs
  against PrestoDB 0.284; both run in continuous integration.
